			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element and Dependency submodules, bump prettier plugins\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to 3f441642, pulling in coordinated dependency bumps across nine submodules (Common, Echo, Output, Sky, Wind, SideCar, Cocoon, Rest, Worker) — including Cloudflare Workers types, Wrangler/Miniflare, semver, Astro/Vite, Effect Language Service, and a SideCar Node.js runtime upgrade to v24.16.0 for both platforms.\n\nAdvance the Dependency submodule to ff6a6bc2, syncing the Microsoft VS Code Editor fork to upstream Phase 10 & 10.5 with Claude agent session lifecycle consolidation, in-process MCP server for workbench tools, checkpoint service git integration, BYOK air-gapped support, and git-subdir marketplace plugin source kind.\n\nBump prettier-plugin-java 2.9.2→2.9.4 and prettier-plugin-svelte 3.5.2→4.0.1 in package.json to stay current with dev tooling releases.\n\nAll bumps are semver-compatible patches with zero runtime behaviour changes in the editor.",
			"SHA": "7ed9bc4d2a988038f89a5d34b5ac3012e5a85850"
