				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule to 0fe35472\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to pull in three commits that add .env.Land file fallback for TierSchemeAssets, bump dependencies across six submodules, normalise ESBuild config style in four submodules, and remove dead code in three submodules.\n\nMountain: Build.rs now walks up to 5 ancestor directories reading $TierSchemeAssets from .env.Land/.env.Land.Sample when the process env var is unset, ensuring build.rs and cfg-gated tier code agree even with stale shell exports.\n\nDependency bumps: @grpc/grpc-js 1.14.3→1.14.4, vitest 4.1.6→4.1.7, @effect/language-service 0.86.1→0.86.2, @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260519.1→4.20260521.1, mocha 11.7.5→11.7.6, astro 6.3.5→6.3.7, @astrojs/compiler-rs 0.2.0→0.2.1, vite 8.0.13→8.0.14, @xterm/xterm 6.1.0-beta.219→220.\n\nStyle: Cocoon, Output, Wind, Worker config files converted to 2-space indent with normalised import ordering and export blocks.\n\nDead code: Unused imports removed from Air and Mountain; unused deps removed from Sky.",
