			"Message": "refactor: Clean up .gitignore and improve line parsing in Rust and TypeScript formatters\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "62e3ef0a93b4315743b847d463a1ef291ddc3155"
		},
		{
